This package builds on dsh-egm (https://github.com/dryw/dsh-egm), the
Elephant-Goldfish Model for DeepSeek Harness by dryw, licensed under the
Apache License, Version 2.0. dsh-egm is a port of the Elephant-Goldfish Model
(https://github.com/google/elephant-goldfish-model), Copyright Google LLC,
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

No files are copied from either project. This package depends on dsh-egm at
runtime for its `egm_reviewer` tool and read-only `egm-reviewer` preset.
Changes relative to dsh-egm: the skills, reviewer personas, brainstorm
lenses, standard, and host plugin here are new, written for tabletop RPG
campaign prep. The reviewer persona structure (core mandates, role,
instructions, output format) and the skill preamble approach follow the
upstream and dsh-egm conventions.

The eight prep steps follow the Lazy Dungeon Master method by Mike Shea
(https://slyflourish.com/eight_steps_2023.html). They are described here in
original words; no text from the book is reproduced.
